# Grouping sets (ADR 0038): ROLLUP and GROUPING() (ADR 0037's RU3 and RU4), and CUBE and GROUPING SETS, each pending
# on the item of ADR 0037's phase 5 that answers it; the forms DuckDB's grammar does not have are syntax errors in both engines.

query IIII rowsort
SELECT zn_city, zn_parent % 3, COUNT(*), SUM(zn_id) FROM zones GROUP BY ROLLUP (zn_city, zn_parent % 3)
